text = "If issues with the plugin arise, navigate to  \"res://addons/gdlogger/data.tres\", ensure it exists and secondly. Try replacing it with a new one by deleting it and right-click in the FileSystem folder > Create new > Resource > Find custom resource \"GDLData\", just make sure it's named \"data.tres\" and it's path is identical. This will reset categories and settings. 

There's an issue with the icons not properly updating their colors in the dock whenever you switch between light and dark themes and base colors. It's fixed by simply reloading the editor which can be done via Project > Reload Current Project or restarting Godot

Note that autoloaded scripts/scenes are loaded in the order as shown in ProjectSettings > Globals > Autoload. 
If another autoload is trying to log an entry before Log.tscn has loaded, it might throw an error or simply not log the entry.
Move Log.tscn higher in the list.

If issues persists afterwards, please open an issue on Github with the link below."
autowrap_mode = 3

